110.2 233.5,112.8 236.0,115.3 238.5,117.6 241.1,119.6 243.6,121.5 246.1,123.2 248.7,124.7 251.2,126.1 253.7,127.3 256.3,128.4 258.8,129.3 261.3,130.2 263.9,130.9 266.4,131.5 268.9,132.1 271.5,132.5 274.0,132.9 276.5,133.3 279.1,133.6 281.6,133.8 284.1,134.0 286.7,134.2 289.2,134.4 291.7,134.5 294.3,134.6 296.8,134.7 299.3,134.7 301.9,134.8 304.4,134.8 306.9,134.9 309.5,134.9 312.0,134.9' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='4.0' y1='135.0' x2='316.0' y2='135.0' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='78.0' y1='139.0' x2='78.0' y2='120.4' stroke='#6d4ae0' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='3 2'/><text x='78.0' y='152.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10.5' font-weight='700' fill='#6d4ae0'>−z<tspan font-size='8' dy='3'>1−α/2</tspan></text><line x1='242.0' y1='139.0' x2='242.0' y2='120.4' stroke='#6d4ae0' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='3 2'/><text x='242.0' y='152.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10.5' font-weight='700' fill='#6d4ae0'>z<tspan font-size='8' dy='3'>1−α/2</tspan></text><text x='242.0' y='165.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10.5' font-weight='700' fill='#6d4ae0'>= 2,05</text><text x='160.0' y='87.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='700'>1 − α = 0,96</text><line x1='68.0' y1='131.2' x2='36.0' y2='105.0' stroke='#c2185b' stroke-width='1'/><text x='8.0' y='102.0' text-anchor='start' font-size='10' fill='#c2185b'>α/2 = 0,02</text><line x1='252.0' y1='131.2' x2='284.0' y2='105.0' stroke='#c2185b' stroke-width='1'/><text x='312.0' y='102.0' text-anchor='end' font-size='10' fill='#c2185b'>α/2 = 0,02</text><text x='160.0' y='148.0' text-anchor='middle' font-size='9.5'>0</text></svg></div><p>Calculamos el error máximo con \\(\\sigma=1{,}8\\) y \\(n=36\\):</p>\\[E=z_{1-\\alpha/2}\\cdot\\frac\\sigma{\\sqrt n}=2{,}05\\cdot\\frac{1{,}8}{\\sqrt{36}}\\]\\[E=2{,}05\\cdot0{,}3=0{,}615\\]<p>Los extremos del intervalo son la media muestral menos y más el error:</p>\\[\\bar x-E=2{,}5-0{,}615=1{,}885\\]\\[\\bar x+E=2{,}5+0{,}615=3{,}115\\]<div class='res'>\\(IC_{0{,}96}(\\mu)=(1{,}885;\\ 3{,}115)\\) %</div><p><b>Conclusión:</b> podemos afirmar, con un nivel de confianza del 96 %, que el rendimiento medio de los depósitos a plazo se encuentra entre 1,885 y 3,115 %.</p></div><div class='ex'><p>El error máximo cometido en la estimación es la semiamplitud del intervalo:</p><div class='res'>\\(E=0{,}615\\) (puntos porcentuales)</div></div>"
