    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Tablas de valores de las rectas frontera:</p><table class='tb'><tr><th>\\(7x-y=-10\\)</th><td>\\(x\\)</td><td>-1</td><td>-2</td></tr><tr><th></th><td>\\(y\\)</td><td>3</td><td>-4</td></tr></table><table class='tb'><tr><th>\\(x+y=2\\)</th><td>\\(x\\)</td><td>0</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><th></th><td>\\(y\\)</td><td>2</td><td>0</td></tr></table><table class='tb'><tr><th>\\(3x-5y=14\\)</th><td>\\(x\\)</td><td>3</td><td>-2</td></tr><tr><th></th><td>\\(y\\)</td><td>-1</td><td>-4</td></tr></table><p>Probamos el origen \\((0,0)\\): \\(0\\ge-10\\), \\(0\\le2\\) y \\(0\\le14\\) se cumplen, así que en cada caso tomamos el semiplano que contiene al origen<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si el origen cumple la inecuación, el semiplano solución es el que lo contiene; si no la cumple, es el otro.</i>.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 330 195' width='100%' style='max-width:340px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='68.0,163.0 248.0,112.0 104.0,44.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.5' stroke='#6d4ae0' stroke-width='1.5'/><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M7 95H316M140 187V3'/></g><text x='310' y='90'>x</text><text x='145' y='11'>y</text><g font-size='10' fill='currentColor'><line x1='32.0' y1='92.0' x2='32.0' y2='98.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='32.0' y='109.0' text-anchor='middle'>-3</text><line x1='68.0' y1='92.0' x2='68.0' y2='98.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='68.0' y='109.0' text-anchor='middle'>-2</text><line x1='104.0' y1='92.0' x2='104.0' y2='98.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='104.0' y='109.0' text-anchor='middle'>-1</text><line x1='176.0' y1='92.0' x2='176.0' y2='98.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='176.0' y='109.0' text-anchor='middle'>1</text><line x1='212.0' y1='92.0' x2='212.0' y2='98.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='212.0' y='109.0' text-anchor='middle'>2</text><line x1='248.0' y1='92.0' x2='248.0' y2='98.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='248.0' y='109.0' text-anchor='middle'>3</text><line x1='284.0' y1='92.0' x2='284.0' y2='98.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='284.0' y='109.0' text-anchor='middle'>4</text><line x1='137.0' y1='163.0' x2='143.0' y2='163.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='166.0' text-anchor='end'>-4</text><line x1='137.0' y1='129.0' x2='143.0' y2='129.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='132.0' text-anchor='end'>-2</text><line x1='137.0' y1='61.0' x2='143.0' y2='61.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='64.0' text-anchor='end'>2</text><line x1='137.0' y1='27.0' x2='143.0' y2='27.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='30.0' text-anchor='end'>4</text></g><line x1='50.0' y1='222.5' x2='113.0' y2='14.2' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='50.0' y1='18.5' x2='305.6' y2='139.2' stroke='#0a9396' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='21.2' y1='176.3' x2='312.8' y2='93.6' stroke='#e07a00' stroke-width='1.6'/><g font-size='10' font-weight='700'><text x='10' y='10' fill='#2f6df0'>7x−y=−10</text><text x='248' y='146' fill='#0a9396'>x+y=2</text><text x='226' y='83' fill='#e07a00'>3x−5y=14</text></g><circle cx='68.0' cy='163.0' r='3.3' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='12.0' y='173.0' font-weight='700'>A(−2,−4)</text><circle cx='248.0' cy='112.0' r='3.3' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='234.0' y='130.0' font-weight='700'>B(3,−1)</text><circle cx='104.0' cy='44.0' r='3.3' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='112.0' y='40.0' font-weight='700'>C(−1,3)</text></svg></div><p>Hallamos sus vértices:</p><ul><li>\\(A:\\;\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}7x-y=-10\\\\3x-5y=14\\end{array}\\right.\\) \\(\\Rightarrow y=7x+10\\) \\(\\Rightarrow3x-35x-50=14\\) \\(\\Rightarrow x=-2,\\ y=-4\\) \\(\\Rightarrow\\boxed{A(-2,-4)}\\)</li><li>\\(B:\\;\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x+y=2\\\\3x-5y=14\\end{array}\\right.\\) \\(\\Rightarrow y=2-x\\) \\(\\Rightarrow3x-10+5x=14\\) \\(\\Rightarrow x=3,\\ y=-1\\) \\(\\Rightarrow\\boxed{B(3,-1)}\\)</li><li>\\(C:\\;\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}7x-y=-10\\\\x+y=2\\end{array}\\right.\\) \\(\\Rightarrow8x=-8\\) \\(\\Rightarrow x=-1,\\ y=3\\) \\(\\Rightarrow\\boxed{C(-1,3)}\\)</li></ul><div class='res'>Vértices: \\(A(-2,-4)\\), \\(B(3,-1)\\) y \\(C(-1,3)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La función \\(F\\) alcanza sus extremos en el recinto, en puntos de su frontera; evaluamos, por tanto, \\(F\\) en los vértices<i class='n' data-t='th'>Teorema fundamental de la programación lineal: si la región factible es un polígono convexo y acotado, la función objetivo alcanza su máximo y su mínimo en alguno de sus vértices.</i>:</p>\\[F(-2,-4)=-4-12=-16\\]\\[F(3,-1)=6-3=3\\]\\[F(-1,3)=-2+9=7\\]<div class='res'>\\(F\\) alcanza un máximo en \\(C(-1,3)\\) de valor 7 y un mínimo en \\(A(-2,-4)\\) de valor \\(-16\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
